    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>To build an equation add terms in the desired sequence into the LHS and RHS.</para>
<para>This class depends on the supply of <ref refid="structcsmp_1_1_i_n_d_e_x" kindref="compound">INDEX</ref> keys for the transport problem, from the USER template parameter.</para>
<para><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_integral_equation" kindref="compound">IntegralEquation</ref> (policy) Operations<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Add( operator&amp; )</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Subtract( operator&amp; )</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>MultiplyWith( operator&amp; )</para>
